{"feed": {"author": {"name": {"label": "iTunes Store"}, "uri": {"label": "http://www.apple.com/uk/itunes/"}}, "entry": [{"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1753451040"}, "name": {"label": "Zubairrrrrrr"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-10-17T06:24:44-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.71"}, "id": {"label": "13278018886"}, "title": {"label": "Metalstorm"}, "content": {"label": "This game is ocm but needs only one thing to do is it should be played as missions also", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1662381815"}, "name": {"label": "Imtiwimti"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-10-11T03:10:17-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.70"}, "id": {"label": "13251920123"}, "title": {"label": "Need new mission or role play"}, "content": {"label": "That\u2019s a great observation \u2014 and you\u2019re absolutely right \ud83d\udcaf.\n\nMetalStorm, while visually engaging and skill-driven, can start to feel repetitive once you\u2019ve mastered aerial duels. The game\u2019s biggest limitation is its one-dimensional gameplay loop (dogfight \u2192 upgrade \u2192 dogfight again).\n\nBut here\u2019s where you can get creative \u2014 even within the MetalStorm framework, you can imagine or simulate new roles, missions, or team-based operations that make it feel more like a living air-combat world rather than just a PvP arena.\n\n\u2e3b\n\n\u2708\ufe0f 1. Squad Roles \u2013 Give Each Jet a Purpose\n\nWhen you play with friends or coordinate with a team, assign military-style roles:\n\t\u2022\t\ud83e\udd85 Air Superiority Pilot: Focus purely on dogfights and enemy interception.\n\t\u2022\t\ud83d\udca3 Strike Leader: Focus on ground-attack or base assault (you can simulate this with target restrictions).\n\t\u2022\t\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Support Pilot (AWACS/ECM): Carry EMP, decoys, or shields \u2014 protect allies and bait enemies.\n\t\u2022\t\u2699\ufe0f Engineer/Resupply Jet (fictional role): Stay behind the formation; call out positions and timing for regrouping.\n\nEven if the game doesn\u2019t formally support these, playing by role makes teamwork feel deeper and more tactical.\n\n\u2e3b\n\n\ud83c\udfaf 2. Custom Mission Ideas to Simulate Variety\n\nYou can set your own mission objectives before each match (especially with friends or squadmates):", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "2"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1091462794"}, "name": {"label": "AryanThappa3"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-10-10T15:13:08-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.70"}, "id": {"label": "13250086656"}, "title": {"label": "\u2708\ufe0f Amazing game but needs more realism!"}, "content": {"label": "Metalstorm is awesome \u2014 graphics and dogfights are top class. But please add takeoff and landing controls, pilot view, and dynamic weather for a true fighter jet experience. These features would make it feel like we\u2019re really in the cockpit! Bring feature of voice chat for team and enemy also .", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1230493220"}, "name": {"label": "BanYourselfBMGI"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-10-03T13:03:12-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.69"}, "id": {"label": "13219553545"}, "title": {"label": "Haptic feedback and duel sense support"}, "content": {"label": "Please work on these things, rumbling & adaptive triggers & haptic would bring this game alive. Also if battle could go 10 to 15 mins in some modes that would be awesome. I\u2019m playing on iPad Pro with ps5 controller. Thank you.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1839070540"}, "name": {"label": "Haryana t jaat raam"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-10-02T09:06:43-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.69"}, "id": {"label": "13214326928"}, "title": {"label": "gach"}, "content": {"label": "takeoff landing ka option or hota to or jyada swad aave arr", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1467752683"}, "name": {"label": "Khima 11"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-09-28T11:09:38-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.68"}, "id": {"label": "13197191095"}, "title": {"label": "Battle with friends in Room"}, "content": {"label": "Hi developers, plzz add (1) On