}, "title": {"label": "Best FOV fighter jet game"}, "content": {"label": "Its a nice game overall just few bugs like on iOS after few gameplay it just starts lagging. Also it takes too long to match and start game which is sometimes irritating. Apart from these tech hurdles the overall design, art, gameplay everything is just soo good.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1569136817"}, "name": {"label": "Trending insta"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-08-19T08:04:01-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.65"}, "id": {"label": "13035682969"}, "title": {"label": "Poor game with no stability"}, "content": {"label": "Poor game, completed a match and also won the match and taken me to homescreen soon after match over and zero trophy as reward. The game is not stabilized and this is happening repeatedly and making frustration. So, please don\u2019t play this game until the game got stabilized", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1821880079"}, "name": {"label": "Sayed ishtiyaq"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-08-17T10:35:26-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.65"}, "id": {"label": "13028140557"}, "title": {"label": "Gameplay issues"}, "content": {"label": "Mumbai server game response is weak and feels laggy have raised complaints in game and through mail no response or may have not looked into the problem", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id571524608"}, "name": {"label": "123jeet"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-08-05T10:12:23-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.64"}, "id": {"label": "12979742808"}, "title": {"label": "Nice"}, "content": {"label": "Wonderful game just needs better graphics", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1607253500"}, "name": {"label": "I.adi.tya"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-08-04T01:41:05-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.64"}, "id": {"label": "12974062730"}, "title": {"label": "Best team fight game"}, "content": {"label": "The amount of adrenaline boost it gives is incredible. And new engine update is surely cherry on top. I will just say that keep bringing new updates soon not just flight pass. So that we won\u2019t find playing boring", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1592192103"}, "name": {"label": "Aksh145"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-07-30T02:16:13-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.64"}, "id": {"label": "12953930035"}, "title": {"label": "Suggesttion"}, "content": {"label": "This game is amazing ,just love the detailing and applied physics it has , just a little suggestion to give this an edge \n1. Add night missions mostly its day or sunset time , but night mission gives extra \nFeel\n\n2.developer should add cockpit view too as 3rd person angle is good but cockpit view gives actual feel of the jet we flying -which further means all detailing inside the cockpit should be good like radar and other sensors should be realistic", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1583933346"}, "name": {"label": "Karthi.__.kn"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-07-29T10:02:26-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.64"}, "id": {"label": "12951318397"}, "title": {"label": "About the game and features"}, "content": {"label": "Yeahhh like all said game is overall ok.but one guy mentioned before no voicechat in game and party,we need that feature it will help us to communicate the party members and friends, kindly bring that in", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1531382351"}, "name": {"label": "Akshay gosavi"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-07-24T07:16:42-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.63"}, "id": {"label": "12930910409"}, "title": {"label": "The best game ever I played"}, "content": {"label": "Realistic graphics, smooth gameplay and nice maps. There should be comms between team mates and missile lock timing is understandable but flares loading time its not suitable so far so good", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1545273720"}, "name": {"label": "Hemant khanvilkar"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-07-23T09:32:26-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.63"}, "id": {"label": "12927333955"}, "title": {"label": "Good but not Best"}, "content": {"label": "23.07.2025 - Recent Days I have face network issues on game. And they didn\u2019t even fix it. Almost every game there is a network problem. I had report several time but not a single response from metalstorm team.\n\n\n\nThe game is good overall and has a lot of potential, especially in terms of graphics and gameplay mechanics. However, it suffers from several major issues that seriously impact the experience:\n\n1. Missing Mission-Based Content \u2013 One of the most important missing features is a mission or campaign mode. Adding structured missions would greatly increase engagement, especially for new players, by giving them clear goals and a reason to keep playing.\n\n2. Frequent Crashes \u2013 The game crashes even on high-end devices like the iPhone 13, which is very disappointing for a mobile title in 2025.\n\n3. No Rank-Based Matchmaking \u2013 For a combat-focused game, this is a major flaw. There\u2019s no skill- or rank-wise matchmaking, which makes battles unbalanced and frustrating.\n\n4. Lack of Control Customization \u2013 Players cannot customize the control layout. This is a basic feature that should be available to allow users to optimize their gameplay experience.\nIf the developers address these problems, Metalstorm could become one of the top mobile fighter games. Until then, it remains an unpolished experience.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1509170536"}, "name": {"label": "Vishalkshaji"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-07-17T13:46:10-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.63"}, "id": {"label": "12904052389"}, "title": {"label": "Addictive"}, "content": {"label": "Do not install this game, because its too addictive.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1382836421"}, "name": {"label": "Zisus Drozario"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-06-25T11:07:12-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.63"}, "id": {"label": "12816437423"}, "title": {"label": "Bored of gameplay"}, "content": {"label": "At one point , am totally bored , of playing the same arcade with capture or TDM match ! I think the graphics and gameplay is very good just this water physics isn\u2019t working , and with all that you have in the ga