making is pathetic. The match making is very uneven.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id787214828"}, "name": {"label": "ZoomcarFan"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-04-20T05:26:47-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.57"}, "id": {"label": "12565397974"}, "title": {"label": "Technical issues on iOS"}, "content": {"label": "Hi There, first of all I want to thank you for the this amazing game !\n\nFew things I want to bring to your notice expecting this fix will be rolled out in future updates if any.\n- Once the game is launched and during the play, the app minimises itself. This is happening frequently thereby leading to unpleasant experience. Due to this, I don\u2019t feel like buying the Flight pass anymore.\n- If the screen not been tapped during the game, the phone screen locks. You may want to provide an update where it can override the default phone lock settings.\n- The matchmaking algorithm still needs work. Reason due to unfair matchmaking. I was once placed in a team with only bits opposite to a team full of Human players.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1662421632"}, "name": {"label": "Anonymous15999"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2025-04-17T06:34:50-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.0.57"}, "id": {"label":